Applicability: Google Play Store & Apple App Store Guidelines Compliant

This Privacy Policy ("Policy") describes how LIFT-COMPLEKS DS, OOO ("Company", "we", "us", or "our") collects, uses, stores, shares, and protects your personal data when you use our mobile application (the "Application"). By accessing or using the Application, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this Policy.


